 masked because they may contain user-authored text verbatim (e.g. new_string in Edit)."}, {"id": "server_systemreminderpreservation", "label": "System Reminder Preservation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "lib/pii-proxy/server.py", "source_location": "line 115", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "<system-reminder> blocks in user messages contain trusted machine-generated content (skills list, CLAUDE.md, MEMORY.md) injected by Claude Code harness \u2014 not user-authored PII. NLP models incorrectly flag these (e.g. 'Claude' as PERSON, dates, IPs). They are passed through unchanged to avoid breaking session context."}, {"id": "server_persondenylist", "label": "Person Allowlist False Positive Filter", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "lib/pii-proxy/server.py", "source_location": "line 126", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Product names like 'Claude' are misclassified as PERSON entities by spaCy NER. An allowlist filters these before anonymization to prevent over-masking of legitimate product-name content in user messages."}], "edges": [{"source": "server_piiproxyhandler", "target": "server_proxymessages", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "lib/pii-proxy/server.py", "source_location": "line 726", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "server_piiproxyhandler", "target": "server_forward", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "lib/pii-proxy/server.py", "source_location": "line 875", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "server_piiproxyhandler", "target": "server_buildupstreamheaders", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "lib/pii-proxy/server.py", "source_location": "line 885", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "server_piiproxyhandler", "target": "server_gethttpsession", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRAC